{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a 2v6 PvP hide-and-seek horror game where <strong>2 players take on the role of dinosaurs</strong>, and the other <strong>6 play as humans</strong> trying to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The humans must <strong>run, hide, and outsmart</strong> the dinosaur players while avoiding being hunted down. A <strong>3-minute countdown</strong> begins at the start of each round. When the timer hits zero, a <strong>rescue helicopter arrives</strong> to extract any surviving humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If <strong>all humans are eliminated</strong>, the <strong>dinosaurs win</strong>. But if even one human survives until extraction, the <strong>humans claim victory</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1916100/253407b897885398018f34a59c736f76607afe9f.jpg"},{"name":"Tiny Tank","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1916100/b712647570cffdc627356f2a7b43dcdac5d8b91c.jpg"},{"name":"Where Am I?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1916100/3244a0b552569f96991b983f8e4a1fc32e078260.jpg"},{"name":"Safe For Now","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1916100/0bb130dd1a64f70e0027f40143545816df98d668.jpg"},{"name":"Dino Egg?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1916100/67e9b87552885a491c22b083bbeaa604a24e5753.jpg"},{"name":"Slippery Meat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1916100/48b2b117f7768c7c97bd96be8b2ab2722842554a.jpg"},{"name":"Thank You!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1916100/1e40815f093f0f84290ef9e6792fbe027f84cf72.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/